# Recorded input for the breadcrumb example page (widgets/breadcrumb.zig, `Page`), at 320 x
# 200 in the default theme: links Home at 8..54 and Docs at 70..115, the current page at
# 131..190, all at y 8..30. Keys are USB HID codes: 40 Enter, 44 Space (format: input.Replay).
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 320 200
dt 0.016
pointer 300 190
# 1: hover Home
frame
pointer 31 19
# 2: press it: it takes focus
frame
buttons left
# 3: release over it: Home followed
frame
buttons
# 4: Space: links do not take it
frame
press 44
# 5: Enter: Home followed again
frame
press 40
# 6: press the current page: not a link
frame
pointer 160 19
buttons left
# 7: release: nothing followed
frame
buttons
